  "notes": "Component reported in block 13 as XMFR/EA is interpreted as the ESF transformer supply breaker whose opening caused the undervoltage; EA (non-Class 1E) bus itself was explicitly stated as unaffected, but is retained per block-13 coded data. AF pump did not actually supply feedwater; BACKED_UP_BY asserted per narrative statement that pumps/EDG actuated/operated as designed during the event window. Previous LER key preserved verbatim as '1-2022-001-00' per instructions, though it appears to conflate Unit 1 and Unit 3 events under one LER number."
